# hqbacktest has no environment variables of its own.
# It reads the CSV snapshots written by the hqdata CLI before a backtest starts.
# The data root is configured in the backtest config; it defaults to ~/.hqdata.
#
# Where data lives:
#   ~/.hqdata/                          default root directory
#   ~/.hqdata/{source}/                 e.g. ~/.hqdata/tushare
#   <configured data_root>/{source}/    e.g. /mnt/market-data/ricequant
#
# Required files in each source directory:
#   calendar.csv
#   stock_list/YYYYMMDD.csv
#   stock_daily/YYYYMMDD.csv
#   stock_factor/YYYYMMDD.csv
#
# Do NOT store real tokens, account numbers, or private paths in this file.